      "title": "Lambda 表达式显式声明参数类型",
      "category": "syntax",
      "risk": "low",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "agent",
      "fallback_engines": ["llm"],
      "pr_mode": "auto",
      "max_changed_lines": 12,
      "complexity_level": "simple",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 5,
        "max_token_budget": 128000,
        "max_files": 1,
        "strategy_hint": "为 lambda 参数补充显式类型声明，只改动目标表达式，避免波及周边逻辑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S3267",
      "title": "循环应简化为 LINQ",
      "category": "refactor",
      "risk": "medium",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "agent",
      "fallback_engines": ["llm"],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 18,
      "fix_scope": "file",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "complexity_level": "moderate",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 6,
        "max_token_budget": 128000,
        "max_files": 1,
        "strategy_hint": "仅在纯内存集合、无副作用、无 IQueryable/EF 风险时，将简单循环安全改写为 LINQ；遇到延迟执行或数据库查询风险时直接跳过。"
      }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S6562",
      "title": "创建 DateTime 时设置 DateTimeKind",
      "category": "time",
      "risk": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "roslyn",
      "fallback_engines": ["agent"],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 12,
      "fix_scope": "file",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "complexity_level": "moderate",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 6,
        "max_token_budget": 128000,
        "max_files": 1,
        "strategy_hint": "默认保持 Local 语义；仅在代码上下文明显表达 UTC 意图时才改为 DateTimeKind.Utc。遇到解析、序列化或时区语义不明确的场景时保守处理。"
      }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S6561",
      "title": "避免使用 DateTime.Now 进行基准测试",
      "category": "time",
      "risk": "medium",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "roslyn",
      "fallback_engines": ["agent"],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 16,
      "fix_scope": "file",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "complexity_level": "moderate",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 6,
        "max_token_budget": 128000,
        "max_files": 1,
        "strategy_hint": "优先把 DateTime.Now/UtcNow 的基准测试模式改成 Stopwatch；只处理典型起止耗时统计，不要碰业务时间逻辑。"
      }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S3776",
      "title": "方法认知复杂度过高",
      "category": "architecture",
      "risk": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "agent",
      "fallback_engines": [],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 40,
      "fix_scope": "file",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "complexity_level": "complex",
        "agent_config": {
          "max_turns": 20,
          "max_token_budget": 256000,
          "max_files": 1,
          "strategy_hint": "默认优先在单文件内用 guard clause、private helper、local block simplification 降低复杂度；除非传播闭包明确且仅触达受控 internal 调用点，否则不要改动公开签名、interface 或 controller。"
        }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S107",
      "title": "方法参数过多",
      "category": "architecture",
      "risk": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "roslyn",
      "fallback_engines": [],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 40,
      "allow_signature_changes": true,
      "fix_scope": "solution",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "requires_solution_path": true,
      "complexity_level": "complex",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 20,
        "max_token_budget": 256000,
        "max_files": 10,
        "allowed_operations": ["read_file", "search_in_project", "get_file_outline", "apply_edit", "create_file", "list_files", "run_build", "finish"],
        "strategy_hint": "优先创建兼容当前仓库语言版本的参数对象，并同步更新当前 solution 内所有调用点；仅在仓库明确支持时才使用 record；遇到接口、端点、override 或 params/ref/out/in 风险时跳过。"
      }
    },
    {
      "rule_id": "csharpsquid:S1172",
      "title": "移除未使用的参数",
      "category": "signature",
      "risk": "high",
      "enabled": true,
      "primary_engine": "roslyn",
      "fallback_engines": ["agent"],
      "pr_mode": "draft",
      "max_changed_lines": 24,
      "allow_signature_changes": true,
      "fix_scope": "solution",
      "classification_required": true,
      "verification_policy": "strict_draft",
      "requires_solution_path": true,
      "complexity_level": "complex",
      "agent_config": {
        "max_turns": 8,
        "max_token_budget": 192000,
        "max_files": 6,
        "allowed_operations": ["read_file", "search_in_project", "get_file_outline", "apply_edit", "list_files", "run_build", "finish"],
        "strategy_hint": "同步删除当前 solution 内未使用参数及其调用点；遇到接口实现、override、Controller Action 或反射敏感成员时跳过。"
      }
    },
    {
